{
 "nodes": [
  {
   "id": "cap-title",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -900,
   "y": -1270,
   "width": 1250,
   "height": 200,
   "text": "# Tencent Hy4-preview — model  \nRead top → bottom, left column (L0–38) then right column (L39–77). **Grey bars = tensors**, length ∝ channels per token (0.08 px/channel). **Boxes = operations**, all one size; where parameters and compute live is the pair of bars above. T = sequence length (up to 1,048,576 = 1M). *Layer* tab = one layer in detail.    \nSources: config.json + safetensors headers of tencent/Hy4-preview; dataflow from transformers `modular_hy_v4.py`."
  },
  {
   "id": "cap-legend",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 450,
   "y": -1270,
   "width": 1250,
   "height": 200,
   "text": "Layer rows — **orange**: dense SwiGLU FFN (18432) · **blue**: MoE + its own DSA indexer (scores all past tokens, keeps top 2048) · **grey**: MoE, **reuses** the top-2048 picks of the last indexer layer (IndexCache). 21 layers run an indexer, 57 reuse one.    \nEvery layer: Gated DSA attention (MLA, 64 heads, q latent 2048, kv latent 512) ≈ **265.7M** (+9.4M indexer) · MoE 256 experts top-8 + 1 shared ≈ **9.70B** (99.6% in routed experts). All 78 layers = **768.42B**."
  },
  {
   "id": "raw1",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 0,
   "y": -1000,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 56,
   "text": "**raw text**  \"The cat sat…\"",
   "color": "#64748b"
  },
  {
