  },
  {
   "id": "band0",
   "type": "group",
   "x": -16,
   "y": -412,
   "width": 332,
   "height": 1600,
   "label": "L0–38",
   "color": "#a3e635"
  },
  {
   "id": "band1",
   "type": "group",
   "x": 884,
   "y": -412,
   "width": 332,
   "height": 1600,
   "label": "L39–77",
   "color": "#a3e635"
  },
  {
   "id": "note-rows",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -500,
   "y": -222,
   "width": 440,
   "height": 210,
   "text": "Each layer = 2 sub-blocks (attention, FFN). Each sub-block reads the 4 residual streams through iHC: a learned sigmoid mix of the 4 streams → one 6144 vector → RMSNorm → sub-block → added back to every stream with its own sigmoid weight (×2). Identity residual; no stream-mixing matrix."
  },
  {
   "id": "note-rows2",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1240,
   "y": -222,
   "width": 440,
   "height": 160,
   "text": "Indexer pattern (config `indexer_types`): L0 and every 4th layer from L1 (L1, L5, … L77) compute fresh top-2048 key positions; the 3 layers after each reuse them — no indexer weights in those layers."
  },
  {
   "id": "ho19",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 804,
   "y": 1232,
   "width": 492,
   "height": 9,
   "text": "",
   "color": "#64748b"
  },
  {
   "id": "ho20",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 804,
   "y": 1246,
   "width": 492,
   "height": 9,
   "text": "",
   "color": "#64748b"
  },
  {
   "id": "ho21",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 804,
   "y": 1260,
   "width": 492,
   "height": 9,
   "text": "",
   "color": "#64748b"
  },
  {
   "id": "ho22",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 804,
